                {
                  "id": "t-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You must be at least 13 years old to use the site. If you are under 18, you need a parent or guardian’s permission to create an account or place an order. You are responsible for keeping your account details secure and for activity on your account.",
