                },
                {
                  "id": "t-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "All prices are shown in U.S. dollars unless stated otherwise. Applicable sales tax is calculated at checkout. We may refuse or cancel an order, for example if a product is unavailable or a pricing error occurs; if we cancel, you will receive a full refund.\n\nLimited, numbered and signed editions are produced in fixed quantities and may sell out.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-8",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "4. Payment",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-9",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Payments are processed securely by Stripe. PIP does not store your card details.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-10",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "5. Shipping & delivery",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-11",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We ship to the addresses and countries offered at checkout. Delivery times are estimates. Customers are responsible for any import duties or taxes charged by their country.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-12",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "6. Returns & refunds",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-13",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Returns and refunds are covered by our <a href=\"/refunds\">Refund & Return Policy</a>.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-14",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "7. Collectibles",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-15",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Trading cards are sold as collectibles for personal enjoyment. PIP makes no promise about future value or resale price. Card statistics and achievement badges reflect official records at the time of production, as described in our <a href=\"/medal-record-policy\">Medal & Record Policy</a>.",
